  Cmn1=EtherGate Channel v1.0\\\\One DMX load on the gateway selected by||1
  Cmn2=Controller.\\\\Port is 1 or 2. Channel is the DMX address, 1-512.
  Cmn3=\\Controller_Override is ignored until an analog value arrives.\\
  Cmn4=After that, 1-8 selects that slot.\\\\Level is percent. 0 is off||1
  Cmn5=and 65535 is DMX 255. Level_FB follows the\\live value, including||1
  Cmn6=while a preset is fading.\\\\This symbol subscribes only to its||1
  Cmn7=own port and channel. A level change\\on another load does not run||1
  Cmn8=this symbol.
[END]
